	"_doc": "The ENGINE-OWNED ontology (TLD `ddengine`) — THE SOURCE OF RECORD for the sections the engine itself writes: today the AI spend ledger (ddengine1..10, a section of its own). Materialized into every installation by src/core/ontology/engine_ontology.ts (boot, install, the suite setup) through the engine's own doors: matrix_ontology `ddengine0` records via the inverse parser, then rebuildOntology derives dd_ontology. Never hand-edit the database copy: an edit there is drift that the next boot rewrites from this file. `retired` lists the nodes the engine once shipped and now PRUNES wherever they survive (source record, dd_ontology row, registry values) — a node is retired here, never merely deleted from `nodes` (a node only absent from this file is a stray the door reports and the rebuild would resurrect). Gates: test/unit/ai_spend_budget_native.test.ts (engine ontology legs), test/unit/engine_ontology_retired_native.test.ts (the pruning).",
